## GitHub Actions on `main` (current release model)

This repo uses **four** workflows so **Expo EAS build quota** is not spent on every merge:

| Workflow file | GitHub name | When it runs | What it does |
|---------------|-------------|----------------|---------------|
| **`.github/workflows/versioning.yml`** | **Auto Version Bump** | **Automatically** on every push to **`main`** (not from the bot’s own bump commit) | Bumps together: **`package.json`** patch version, **`ios.buildNumber`** in **`app.config.js`**, and **`android.versionCode`** in **`app.config.js`**. Commits and pushes with **`[skip ci]`** so it does not re-trigger itself. |
| **`.github/workflows/production-build.yml`** | **Android Production Build** | **Manual only** (`Run workflow`) | EAS **`eas build`** Android **`production`** APK. **Does not** bump versions — use the commit **`main`** is on **after** auto bump (or merge, wait for bump, then run). |
| **`.github/workflows/android-play-bundle.yml`** | **Android Play Bundle (AAB)** | **Manual only** (`Run workflow`) | EAS **`eas build`** Android **`production-play`** app bundle (**.aab**) for **Google Play** uploads. Same **`APP_VARIANT`** as production APK; **does not** bump versions. **Does not** submit to Play yet — download the **.aab** from **EAS** and create a release in **Play Console** (or add **`eas submit`** later). |
| **`.github/workflows/ios-testflight.yml`** | **iOS TestFlight Release** | **Manual only** (`Run workflow`) | EAS **`eas build`** iOS **`production`**, then **`eas submit`** to App Store Connect / **TestFlight**. Injects **`ascAppId`** from secret **`ASC_APP_ID`** into **`eas.json`** for non-interactive submit. **Does not** bump versions. |

**Secrets (Actions):** **`EXPO_TOKEN`** (EAS). iOS submit also needs **App Store Connect API** material in GitHub (**`ASC_API_KEY`**, **`ASC_API_KEY_ID`**, **`ASC_API_KEY_ISSUER_ID`**, **`ASC_APP_ID`**). If Apple returns **`FORBIDDEN.REQUIRED_AGREEMENTS_MISSING_OR_EXPIRED`**, accept pending agreements in **App Store Connect → Agreements, Tax, and Banking** (not a code fix). See **`Learnings.mdc`** (EAS CI / TestFlight section) for pitfalls already hit in this project.

**Typical release sequence after merging to `main`:** wait for **Auto Version Bump** to finish (green) → run **Android APK**, **Android Play Bundle (AAB)**, and/or **iOS TestFlight** manual workflows only for what you want to ship this cycle.

