## End-to-end workflow (high level)

1. **Develop & test** — feature branch, **SleepFactor Dev**, dev server (**tunnel** preferred; **LAN** if tunnel/ngrok fails). **Android first** when possible; **also validate on iPhone** after native, HealthKit, or iOS-facing changes.
2. **Review** — PR, checks, merge to **`main`** when approved.
3. **Version bump on `main`** — **Auto Version Bump** runs and aligns **`package.json`**, **iOS build number**, and **Android versionCode** in one commit.
4. **Ship binaries when needed** — manually run **Android Production Build** (APK), **Android Play Bundle (AAB)**, and/or **iOS TestFlight Release** in GitHub Actions (each consumes EAS cloud builds only when you run it).

