## Version control & branching

- **`main`:** Stable, production-oriented code (protect from direct pushes when using branch rules).
- **Feature branches:** `feature/...` for new work.

```bash
git checkout -b feature/your-feature-name
git add .
git commit -m "Describe change"
git push origin feature/your-feature-name
```

**PR process:** Open PR → review → automated checks → merge to **`main`**.

**Why:** Reduces accidental production breaks, keeps review and CI in the loop.

---

## Development testing checklist

- [ ] App launches; navigation works; data persists; network calls succeed
- [ ] Errors are user-appropriate; performance acceptable on device
- [ ] **Android** UI (primary day-to-day); **iPhone** when iOS/native changed
- [ ] Dev server (**tunnel** or **LAN**) connects; live reload works on **SleepFactor Dev**
- [ ] Production **APK** path understood: **Android Production Build** → APK from **EAS** (optional **GitHub Release** link for testers)
- [ ] Play **AAB** path understood: **Android Play Bundle (AAB)** → **.aab** from **EAS** → upload in **Play Console** testing tracks

---

## Production / release checklist

**Android (GitHub path):**

- [ ] **Auto Version Bump** completed on **`main`** before the manual Android build
- [ ] **Android Production Build** (APK) and/or **Android Play Bundle (AAB)** workflow run succeeded; artifact obtained from **EAS** (APK for sideload; **.aab** for Play Console)

**iOS (EAS path):**

- [ ] **Auto Version Bump** on **`main`** completed before the manual iOS release (or build numbers manually ahead of last App Store Connect upload)
- [ ] **iOS TestFlight Release** workflow (or local **`eas build`**) **production** succeeded
- [ ] **`eas submit`** (in workflow or locally) succeeded; build **processed** in App Store Connect
- [ ] TestFlight **internal**/**external** groups point at the new build

---

## Troubleshooting (short)

**Dev:** Node 20+; `npm install`; **`npx expo start --dev-client --clear`**; **`eas login`**. Native modules missing in dev → rebuild **dev client**. **Google Sign-In** / OAuth: see **`Learnings.mdc`** (SHA-1, bundle IDs, Supabase).

**Android prod:** GitHub Actions logs; **`EXPO_TOKEN`**; **`package.json`** version format.

**iOS EAS:** Credentials in Expo; **`Learnings.mdc`** for Pod/Xcode errors.

