## Daily summary for LLMs

| Stage | Action |
|-------|--------|
| Dev | Branch → **SleepFactor Dev** + `expo start --dev-client` (tunnel/LAN) |
| Merge | PR → **`main`** → **Auto Version Bump** (version + iOS build + Android versionCode) |
| Android prod APK | **Actions → Android Production Build** (manual) → EAS APK |
| Android Play AAB | **Actions → Android Play Bundle (AAB)** (manual) → EAS **.aab** → Play Console |
| iOS beta | **Actions → iOS TestFlight Release** (manual) → EAS build → submit → **TestFlight** groups |
| Website | **SleepfactorWebsite** local serve → push → Pages smoke test |

When advising **how to test**, state whether behavior should match **iOS and Android** or is **platform-specific** (per **`IOS-Android-testing.mdc`**).
